 ## 3\. Introduction

 **ComicCraft** is an AI-powered comic story creation application designed to help users transform simple ideas into structured comic stories.

 The system uses Gemini models to assist with story generation, character development, scene creation, dialogue generation, and comic-panel planning. Users can review, edit, and regenerate individual parts of the generated comic.

 ## 4\. Problem Statement

 Creating a comic requires several creative and technical skills, including story writing, character development, dialogue creation, scene planning, and visual composition.

 Beginners may have creative ideas but lack the skills or resources required to convert those ideas into complete comics.

 **ComicCraft addresses this problem by providing an AI-assisted workflow that guides users from an initial idea to a structured comic.**

 ## 5\. Project Objectives

 The main objectives are:

 1. Develop an easy-to-use AI comic creation platform.
2. Use Gemini models for intelligent story assistance.
3. Generate characters based on the user's story.
4. Divide stories into scenes and comic panels.
5. Generate context-aware dialogue.
6. Allow users to edit and regenerate AI-generated content.
7. Provide an organized comic preview.
8. Store and manage user projects.

 ## 6\. Existing System

 Traditional comic creation generally requires users to manually perform several tasks:

```
Idea
 ↓
Manual Story Writing
 ↓
Character Design
 ↓
Scene Planning
 ↓
Dialogue Writing
 ↓
Panel Planning
 ↓
Comic Creation
```

 This can require considerable time and multiple creative tools.

 ## 7\. Proposed System

 ComicCraft integrates these activities into one application:

```
User Idea
    ↓
Gemini Story Generation
    ↓
Character Generation
    ↓
Scene Generation
    ↓
Panel Planning
    ↓
Dialogue Generation
    ↓
Comic Preview
```

 The user can modify individual components instead of starting over when a generated result needs improvement.

