 ## 14\. User Manual

 The user manual should explain the application in simple steps.

 ### Step 1 — Create a Project

 Click **Create New Comic**.

 ### Step 2 — Enter an Idea

 Enter a short description of the desired story.

 ### Step 3 — Generate Story

 Click **Generate Story** and review the AI-generated result.

 ### Step 4 — Create Characters

 Review the generated characters and modify them if required.

 ### Step 5 — Generate Scenes

 Allow ComicCraft to divide the story into scenes.

 ### Step 6 — Generate Panels

 Convert scenes into comic panels.

 ### Step 7 — Edit

 Modify dialogue, descriptions, characters, or individual panels.

 ### Step 8 — Preview

 View the complete comic in the comic-preview interface.

 ### Step 9 — Export

 Export the completed comic if the export functionality is enabled.

