 ## 17\. Limitations

 Possible limitations to document include:

 - AI-generated stories may require human editing.
- Generated dialogue may occasionally lack the desired tone.
- Maintaining visual consistency across many comic panels can be challenging.
- AI generation depends on API availability and usage limits.
- Generated content may not always perfectly match the user's intended concept.

