 ## 19\. Conclusion

 **ComicCraft** demonstrates how Gemini-powered AI can assist users throughout the comic creation process. Instead of requiring users to manually perform every stage, the application provides an integrated workflow for **story ideation, character development, scene planning, dialogue generation, and comic-panel organization**.

 The documentation phase consolidates the project's requirements, architecture, implementation, testing, and results into a structured reference that can be used for **project evaluation, maintenance, presentation, and future development**.
